Package: infereportR
Type: Package
Title: Tables, Text and Plot Annotations for Statistical Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", , "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Formats finalized statistical results as tables, text and
    optional plot annotations. Results follow the common result contract of
    'infercalcR'; stored estimates, intervals, p-values and method metadata
    are reported at full precision and are never recomputed. Optional
    'ggplot2' layers annotate plots with the stored results, and an
    optional adapter renders precomputed 'DescrTab2' descriptive tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: infercalcR (>= 0.1.0), utils
Suggests: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), DescrTab2, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/infereportR,
    https://cttir.github.io/infereportR/
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/infereportR/issues
Config/Needs/website: CTTIR/themakR
